k-146934" data-testid="secondaryHero" class="H102 ddl-hero ddl-hero--secondary ddl-hero--text-light ddl-hero--overlay-dark ddl-hero--secondary-jumplinks"><div class="ddl-hero__aspect-ratio"><div class="ddl-hero__background"><div data-testid="image" class="C111 ddl-image"><picture><source media="(min-width:80rem)" srcSet="https://media.copeland.com/97ab5b2b-a74a-4f29-a280-b15d00043f2a/H002-Refcon_4%3a1.jpg?width=1920"/><source media="(min-width:48rem )" srcSet="https://media.copeland.com/97ab5b2b-a74a-4f29-a280-b15d00043f2a/H002-Refcon_2%3a1.jpg?width=960"/><img src="https://media.copeland.com/97ab5b2b-a74a-4f29-a280-b15d00043f2a/H002-Refcon_4%3a3.jpg?width=1200" alt="seaport container terminal" title="seaport container terminal" class="ddl-image__img" fetchPriority="high"/></picture></div></div><div class="ddl-grid ddl-hero__grid"><div class="ddl-hero__content"><h1 class="ddl-hero__heading">REFCON Vessel and Terminal Monitoring</h1><div class="ddl-hero__description">Site monitoring system for refrigerated containers enabling M2M communication <br /></div><div class="ddl-hero__btn-group btn-group"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="app-main-content-area"><div id="RichTextBlock-348564" class="C120 ddl-rich-text"><div class="ddl-container"><div class="ddl-grid"><div class="ddl-grid__col-12"><p class="p2" style="text-align: center;">REFCON 6 automatically monitors an entire vessel or container terminal. Two-way communication between an operator and every single reefer container can take place 24/7, and all data are logged for event history and documentation purposes. REFCON 6 makes sure that the cargo is never left unattended. It&rsquo;s control made simple and easy.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Control the entire fleet and chain with ProAct Transport</strong>&trade;</p>
<p>Data from local REFCON 6 systems are consolidated and stored by ProAct Transport. Centralization of data on a secure web server makes it possible for shipping lines and container terminals to establish automated remote management of all reefer containers, covering their entire journey from producer to final destination.</p>
<p><img style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" src="https://media.copeland.com/a362a820-5184-4407-b29e-b15d00043d3c/C034-refcon.png" /></p></div></div></div></div><div id="AprimoHtml5PlayerBlock-395012" data-testid="HtmlVideoPlayer" class="C110 ddl-aprimo-video-player "><div class="ddl-video-player"><div class="ddl-video-player__thumbnail"><svg focusable="false"><use href="/ddl-icons.svg#ddl-icon--global_video-play"></use></svg><div class="ddl-video-player__caption"><h3>REFCON 6 Introduction</h3></div></div><div class="ddl-videoplayer__player"></div></div></div><div id="PromoBlock-181164" class="P101 ddl-promo-block  "><div class="ddl-container"><div class="ddl-grid"><div class="ddl-grid__col-7 ddl-grid__col-md-6 ddl-grid__col-sm-12"><div class="ddl-promo-block__section-header"><h2>The safest way to transport refrigerated cargo</h2></div><div class="ddl-rich-text"><p>“Using REFCON onboard our vessel with 1100 reefer plugs equals a reduction of manhours worth 21,900 € for a period of 9 months.” ​​​​​​​</p></div></div><div class="ddl-grid__col-4 ddl-grid__col-md-6 ddl-grid__col-sm-12"><div class="ddl-promo-block__promo-content-area"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="C118 ddl-filterable-list scroll-margin-target ddl-filterable-list--gray" id="FilterableListBlock-146939"><div class="ddl-container"><div class="ddl-grid"><div class="ddl-grid__col-8 ddl-grid__col-sm-12"><h3>   </h3></div><div class="ddl-grid__col-4 ddl-grid__col-sm-12"><div class="ddl-filterable-list__select-language"><div class="ddl-form-field ddl-filterable-list__select-language"><label class="ddl-field__label d-none-label" for="filterId">Language Selector</label><select class="ddl-form-select ddl-form-select--light-background" id="filterId"><option value="English" selected="">English</option></select></div></div></div><div class="ddl-grid__col-12"><div class="ddl-filterable-list__tabs-container"><div class="ddl-filterable-list__tabs" role="tablist"><li class="ddl-filterab